Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.94,0:00:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.85,0:00:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.77,0:00:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Right where I want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.80,0:00:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work, Meester.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.18,0:00:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep moving upwards, we\Nshould ward off any further attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.66,0:00:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I finally understand\Nhow those backstabbing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.58,0:00:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,hooligans managed to\Nbetray the boss and live.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Seko, did you capture their agonized mugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how much I love\Nthe totally desperate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,contortions they make while\Nfighting for their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.18,0:01:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But a vis-simile seko!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.90,0:01:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As our curiosity continues to grow, so\Ntoo does the boldness of our keen spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.80,0:01:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And it is the very same inquisitiveness\Nthat fuels our cognitive evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.66,0:01:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I yearn to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.12,0:01:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What glorious grimaces will they unveil as\Nthey wrestle with the cold jaws of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.28,0:01:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.82,0:01:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A little reward for my intrepid cameraman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.82,0:01:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How does two sound? Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You want three?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.00,0:01:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Gracious, three whole treats?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.64,0:01:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.55,0:01:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.47,0:01:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.38,0:01:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Greedy mutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.29,0:01:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, three it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.21,0:01:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they're coming at you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, whoops, my bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.38,0:02:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,psycho, yes, you are! Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.78,0:02:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you to find\NBucerati and his band of idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.22,0:02:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Be sure to let them have a\Nlittle taste of sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.84,0:02:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.86,0:02:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.20,0:02:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.32,0:02:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay cold
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.17,0:03:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Achimari no Kogelin
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.30,0:04:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.21,0:04:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,our number one priority should be making\Nit to Rome as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.24,0:04:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Giorno, how goes\NNarancia's treatment?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Healing him here is going\Nto be kind of tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.14,0:04:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,His injuries are all teeming\Nwith an aggressive mold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.62,0:04:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We're clear to ascend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.24,0:04:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get to the top of those stairs\Nand hit the road as fast as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.76,0:04:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That was cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What has gotten into him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.42,0:04:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.86,0:04:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't even think to\Nask if Narancia was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, before that,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.06,0:04:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,when you guys were desperately\Nstruggling to get out of the boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,remember what he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He ordered you to toss the turtle like you\Nwere all just disposable pieces of trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.22,0:04:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you so pissed about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course he said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.48,0:04:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the idiot who got on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.30,0:04:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm glad we're alive and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:04:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't forget that we nearly\Ndied because of my stupid ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.23,0:05:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,if Bucciarati hadn't told\Nme to throw the turtle,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.08,0:05:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I might have ended up\Ndropping it in the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.74,0:05:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't need a lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.50,0:05:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I'm trying to say is, he\Ncould stand to be a little nicer to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll admit, I've never really been that\Ngood at talking about feelings and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.24,0:05:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm guessing you wouldn't be so\Nmad if he just asked if you were okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I got it right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Difference between you and me is I\Nalready know how Bucciarati thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.24,0:05:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but it looks like you're\Nstill trying to figure
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.74,0:05:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,out how to get inside\Nthat weird head of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.74,0:05:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, all that matters right now\Nis getting to Rome in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.72,0:05:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have all the time you need\Nto sort out your feelings later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not feeling too hot right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me get some shut-eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.70,0:05:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we gotta keep climbing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but what are we gonna do on the\Noff chance we have to descend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.29,0:06:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This village was built into the mountainside,\Nmeaning the roads are on an incline.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, keep in mind there's still\Nsome traffic on the outskirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.48,0:06:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The mold has yet to\Nspread too far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.94,0:06:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can get to a vehicle and\Nleave immediately, we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We must stay focused on Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.20,0:06:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So, which car should we take?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The one next to the dead body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,With any luck, we just might be able\Nto find the key to the ignition on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Startled by a mere hand\Ndecaying from the mold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.22,0:06:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep a watch on our rear, while you\Nsprint to the car as quickly as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.54,0:06:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.06,0:06:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, hold on. Just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.80,0:06:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt something. Get a move on. Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there and gawk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and climb those stairs like I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm trying to do, Buterati!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.78,0:07:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.69,0:07:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're starting to sink!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.94,0:07:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sliding off of the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the ground's gonna\Nsmalow this whole damn staircase.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This has to be the work of another stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.68,0:07:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mold user has a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.48,0:07:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw me sideways.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.88,0:07:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If we keep sinking, this mold's gonna\Nmelt our asses down into puddles of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.02,0:07:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, my gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.78,0:07:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not sinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.66,0:07:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire staircase itself is\Ndissolving right into the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.46,0:07:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.37,0:07:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They're rushing toward a\Nlocation from beneath the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.56,0:07:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, get on the wall now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Zipperman!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.92,0:08:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,To counter me this fast, not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.88,0:08:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's something else to their power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.48,0:08:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The ground feels oddly hard to\Nthe touch, even through my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.70,0:08:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet I continue to sink in spite\Nof its solidity. Meanwhile,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.74,0:08:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,my opponent can freely move around\Nbeneath me as if the stairs were liquid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Merda!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.99,0:08:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've no way of finding them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.40,0:08:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a total guessing game!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the crap out of your\Ndamn ears, six bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back to Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.78,0:08:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A flesh-eating fungus, and\Nnow a subterranean predator.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.02,0:08:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of them deftly working\Ntogether in tandem to take us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.92,0:08:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll admit I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.62,0:08:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A flawless duo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.92,0:08:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We've yet to encounter\Nsuch a pair of killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.60,0:08:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe these violent little assholes\Nshould hurry up and get married already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right on the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Our decaying friend over there\Nstill got the key to his ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Strunzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.42,0:09:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I saw him pop out just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.90,0:09:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The goddamn coward just dove\Nfrom the stairs to the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.10,0:09:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we make it to\Nthe car in one piece,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.32,0:09:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,we won't have enough\Ntime to start the engine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.50,0:09:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stop this guy dead in his tracks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.54,0:09:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You go on ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.76,0:09:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop running!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.88,0:09:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The ground is still in its solid state!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.96,0:09:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bullets will ricochet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If this quicksand shit's gonna\Nstay hard like normal ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to get him when\Nhe tries to pull me under.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.02,0:09:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy likes to hit hard from up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet his range sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be able to see him\Nthe second he tries to get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's murder time, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.74,0:09:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.65,0:10:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you couldn't stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.44,0:10:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.34,0:10:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.90,0:10:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Of freakin' course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.28,0:10:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've guessed a close\Nrange power base stand
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.78,0:10:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,would have some way to defend\Nitself against bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, you're not the only\None who knows that trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.90,0:10:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My little buddies can deflect bullets too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Those first three shots should...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.80,0:10:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he saving me\Nfor later he must think
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.20,0:10:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,i've become an easy target\Nnow that i'm wounded?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.30,0:10:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and pick up the key\NBuchananthi start the engine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.50,0:10:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell man get inside the damn car
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,if we're able to drive\Nout of this village!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.88,0:10:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine. Just as long as\Nwe all keep heading to Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is that guy running off to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:10:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:11:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're tracking our movements\Nfrom beneath the earth, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite a terrifying power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But, what is your extent?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you really discern my true intentions?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems not even you\Npossess that ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.26,0:11:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see it on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.42,0:11:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,THE FACE COUNCIL
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.52,0:11:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Arab Nelchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.06,0:11:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My face!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.12,0:11:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My face!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.34,0:12:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.25,0:12:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cioccolata!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.28,0:12:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days ago, you heard the news, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the stand that the boss put\Non the airplane thingy? Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.40,0:12:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Notorious Chase is what I\Nthink I heard it was called!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.82,0:12:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Seko, aren't you supposed to be busy\Nhunting down those bastards like I asked?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.24,0:12:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't waste time chatting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Cioccolata, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is important, very important!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.06,0:12:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Notorious Chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a living stand, or\Nis it a dead stand? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.34,0:12:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you asking all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it sounds like a stupid question,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.36,0:12:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.94,0:12:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's say that Notorious Chase\Nwere here right now with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:13:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You think your mold would be\Nable to grow on him at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, do you know if it would\Nbe able to grow on a dead stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.02,0:13:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Notorious Chase, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the one whose user was filled\Nwith so much vengeance and hatred,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,his stand found a way to live\Non even after he was killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.88,0:13:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.08,0:13:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I confess I'm kind of curious myself,\Nbut I don't have the foggiest idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.98,0:13:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What I do know is that\Ngreen tea will putrefy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.08,0:13:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,any living organism it\Ncomes into contact with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So the mold won't grow on rocks and\Nother non-alive stuff, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.28,0:13:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.44,0:13:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you to film those\Nfools with their death row,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.94,0:13:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,so stop dawdling and hop to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.68,0:13:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but that's the thing, Cioccolata!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.36,0:13:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a gander at the hill!\NUp there! On the road! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.50,0:13:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Seko, why am I watching\Na car leave the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.28,0:13:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't tell me the passengers\Nare who I think they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.66,0:13:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you letting them get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.84,0:13:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know! I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.34,0:13:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It all happened so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:14:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually hit me right in my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.74,0:14:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That Bucciarati guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There wasn't any mold\Non him, not even a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.54,0:14:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And I even watched him jump down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,HE SHOULDN'T HAVE BEEN ABLE TO\NATTACK ME FROM WHERE HE WAS!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.14,0:14:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,AAAAAAAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.05,0:14:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,THERE'S NO WAY IT COULD\NHAVE BEEN POSSIBLE!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.16,0:14:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,HIS BODY MUST SOMEHOW\NBE RESISTED TO THE MOLD!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.52,0:14:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,HOW IS THIS EVEN HAPPENING?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I HAVEN'T THE SLIGHTEST.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.88,0:14:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,you had me fooled for a sec there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.94,0:14:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually thought you'd\Nplunge to your own death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You scared the crap out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it zippers you used to\Ncling onto the wall like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.20,0:14:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you didn't get\Nan ounce of mold on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mista, you should get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.62,0:14:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I closed your wounds, but they\Ncould start bleeding again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You just sit back and let me keep a\Nlookout for any cars that are on our tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.74,0:14:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.48,0:15:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, your wrist is injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.26,0:15:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks pretty bad from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me patch you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.32,0:15:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bucciarati, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.12,0:15:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a chance the mold\Nhas infected your wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.96,0:15:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.80,0:15:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no warmth on his skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.12,0:15:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And his pulses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.50,0:15:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonah, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem a little perturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.64,0:15:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Did that really just happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So it wasn't just my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exactly like that\Nother time in Venice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.80,0:16:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he was acting strange back\Nthen, but I'd written it off as nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.18,0:16:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I was careless, but perhaps\NI've realized this just a second too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.40,0:16:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm quickly losing all feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't had my sense of\Ntouch for quite a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.56,0:16:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Yer, then that means when you rescued\NTrish from the boss back in Venice...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Uchirati, you can't\Nreally be saying you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.84,0:16:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd already come to\Naccept this as destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought of it as a little gift\Nhanded down to me from heaven above.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.76,0:16:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The life force you gave my\Nwounded body could not save me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.28,0:16:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,even though I'm certain\Nyou intended it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, all it has\Ndone is delay the inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.91,0:16:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to keep this from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:16:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.05,0:17:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Wind was perfectly able to heal\Nall your injuries without a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.82,0:17:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that it can do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.86,0:17:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reason it can't\Nfix whatever's wrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, I know this is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.30,0:17:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But even your Golden Wind\Nunderstands this truth
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,much better than anyone\Nelse I would expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can free a person\Nfrom Death's stubborn grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time you'd reached\Nme, it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.12,0:17:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Death has me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you will keep\Nthis matter between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.36,0:17:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.80,0:17:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just ask me to accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.80,0:17:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Jonah, quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, can you hear it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.90,0:17:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is it just me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see any other cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.74,0:17:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your ears then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.52,0:17:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing's coming in hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.10,0:17:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.20,0:17:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Up above, it's a helicopter!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's raining mold down on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:18:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?! Put it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow the hell down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.78,0:18:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This road goes downhill!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.26,0:18:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll trigger the mold!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Juno! Masa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're abandoning ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.82,0:18:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep climbing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.08,0:18:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Get as far up as you possibly can!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.88,0:18:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The subconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.54,0:18:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what stands are meant to reflect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.30,0:18:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They're supposed to\Nmirror their users' minds
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.54,0:18:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,if there's even a trace\Nof guilt in their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.32,0:18:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The user may subconsciously\Nstop themselves at some point,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but this Katsune he revels in carnage!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.74,0:18:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all he lives for. His\Nstand is cruelty incarnate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.54,0:18:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What a heartless monster\Nthere are no brakes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.44,0:18:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,On that freak train, hey\Nstay with me now, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.06,0:18:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Papa. We'll get a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait stop it. You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.12,0:18:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go down the hill I have\Nto go get a doctor for my job!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.84,0:18:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, what's going on there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.80,0:18:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This damn mold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's spreading like fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Despicable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.11,0:19:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Rome's population is in the millions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.08,0:19:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It completely dwarfs that fishing village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.22,0:19:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention it's home\Nto some of the boss's men.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He would suffer collateral damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.50,0:19:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This Thronzo doesn't even care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.40,0:19:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just having the time of his life!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, he's gonna\Nwipe out all of Rome!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.16,0:19:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's to stop him from\Nmoving on to the next big city?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our troubles don't end there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.18,0:19:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In the event that we fail to make haste,\Nthe mode is almost sure to outrun us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.22,0:19:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll cut through the Coliseum\Nlong before we can get to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.30,0:19:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell if that helicopter\Nis within your range?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.02,0:19:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your answer better be yes, cause\Nit's our only path forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.22,0:19:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring this bastard back down to Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.06,0:19:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear that, fellas?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.26,0:19:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.17,0:19:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,One-downed helicopter coming right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.58,0:19:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.02,0:20:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The chopper was the diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.92,0:20:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.30,0:20:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one hell of a tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A flying hunk of metal to cover\Nthe ground-melting weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.84,0:20:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Seko has landed safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.46,0:20:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Or should I say submerged.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, those morons\Nhave no means of escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.06,0:20:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Admittedly, the weather is quite lovely\Nfor a blind date at the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shame that Green Tea\Nand I will have to rain on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.05,0:20:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna close in on us soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.52,0:20:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And falling back downhill's not an option!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, focus on the helicopter!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.86,0:20:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot allow him to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.10,0:20:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard will fall by my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.86,0:20:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to break it to you, but\Nyour hands ain't gonna reach him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.04,0:20:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't light up a proper shot for\Nhis tank or propellers from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.74,0:20:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.94,0:20:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't know for sure until you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.60,0:21:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, it's too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.50,0:21:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me when I say I know the extent of\Nmy bullets range better than anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,See what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He got away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.05,0:21:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that homicidal badger's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.96,0:21:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We just landed a direct hit, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you and I are gonna\Ngo take down that pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.68,0:21:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.74,0:21:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you can't mean, on foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.46,0:21:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.37,0:21:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How did...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.12,0:21:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to exterminate the mold before\Nit has a chance to reach the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.72,0:21:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Our underground friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.26,0:21:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving him to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.24,0:21:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Get going, ragazzi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.94,0:21:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.74,0:22:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up, join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.28,0:22:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, just see us alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.76,0:22:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.24,0:22:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'll see the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.42,0:22:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we are the fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.40,0:22:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just fighting for Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.22,0:22:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.16,0:22:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,be
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.08,0:22:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.22,0:24:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.13,0:24:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,you.
